WEBVTT

00:02.140 --> 00:06.810
I'm sure Mokkan is having quite an exciting time at Subarun's place right now!

00:06.810 --> 00:09.610
She's probably taking a bath right now.

00:10.860 --> 00:12.190
Oh!

00:12.190 --> 00:14.030
Onii-chan and Tomoka!

00:14.030 --> 00:17.030
Are they bonding naked in the bathtub together?

00:17.030 --> 00:18.240
N-Naked?!

00:18.240 --> 00:19.950
Airi, calm down.

00:19.950 --> 00:22.200
I doubt they took a bath together.

00:22.200 --> 00:23.830
Y-Yeah.

00:23.830 --> 00:27.830
But how will this make her better at catching his passes?

00:28.000 --> 00:29.370
U-Um...

00:29.370 --> 00:31.290
Let me tell you!

00:30.920 --> 00:33.170
Thank you for waiting.

00:31.290 --> 00:32.290
Basically...

00:32.290 --> 00:35.960
Mokkan is in a slump because she's too nervous!

00:33.170 --> 00:34.500
N-No problem.

00:35.960 --> 00:40.260
This was the first time Tomo played on the same team as Hasegawa-san.

00:36.840 --> 00:40.260
Um, you can sleep on
the bed, Tomoka.

00:40.260 --> 00:44.430
Hasegawa-san has always been on the other team during practice, right?

00:42.140 --> 00:45.970
I-I'll be sleeping on the bed you always sleep in, Subaru-san?

00:44.430 --> 00:46.980
You're right, now that I think about it.

00:45.970 --> 00:49.940
Y-Yeah, I've changed the sheets recently, so it's not dirty at all.

00:46.980 --> 00:47.890
Oh?

00:47.890 --> 00:51.230
Tomoka was nervous because she likes Onii-chan?

00:49.940 --> 00:54.480
No! I'm fine with
sleeping on the floor!

00:51.230 --> 00:52.610
That's right!

00:52.610 --> 00:55.730
So if she is in an even more exciting event,

00:54.480 --> 00:57.530
That won't do!
You're the guest!

00:55.730 --> 00:58.490
then she'll become just fine in basketball!

00:57.530 --> 00:59.490
Please sleep on the bed today.

00:58.490 --> 00:59.490
I see.

00:59.490 --> 01:02.570
Then I hope she gets all the excitement she can!

00:59.910 --> 01:02.990
A-All right.

01:02.570 --> 01:04.200
Hehe. That's right.

01:02.990 --> 01:04.990
Thanks, Tomoka.

01:12.830 --> 01:14.710
I-I'm sorry for being so incompetent,

01:15.090 --> 01:17.590
but please teach me well!

01:17.590 --> 01:20.380
T-Tomoka, that sounds kinda wrong.

01:24.550 --> 01:27.640
Make them see that halation!

01:27.640 --> 01:31.060
We'll carry out the oath we made that day.

01:31.060 --> 01:34.140
Spread out, new formation!

01:34.140 --> 01:37.610
We can see the signs as we call out for one another.

01:37.610 --> 01:43.900
Place your hopes in it, shoot, and watch the arch!

01:44.190 --> 01:48.820
I believe in you, do it like you always do.

01:48.820 --> 01:50.490
Leave it to me.

01:50.490 --> 01:57.040
Put your hands on your chest, and calm yourself down.

01:57.040 --> 02:03.340
I remember each and every granted wish,

02:03.340 --> 02:09.220
including that day I cried in secret.

02:09.220 --> 02:12.720
We're not the only ones

02:12.720 --> 02:16.270
seeing these same dreams.

02:16.270 --> 02:19.900
The sparks in those unyielding eyes

02:19.900 --> 02:23.030
that appeared in front of me,

02:23.030 --> 02:24.610
let them fly!

02:24.900 --> 02:28.030
Make them see that halation!

02:28.030 --> 02:31.370
Run into that open space!

02:31.370 --> 02:38.000
This lingering sensation, looking back on those carefree days.

02:38.000 --> 02:44.550
After saying farewell, you smile with everyone else,

02:44.550 --> 02:50.840
aim for the place you dreamed of, shoot, and watch the arch!

02:53.020 --> 02:57.520
Overnight Sensation!

03:02.040 --> 03:03.040
Can't sleep?

03:03.440 --> 03:05.120
Ah, yes.

03:05.120 --> 03:07.120
My heart is beating so hard.

03:07.120 --> 03:10.040
I see. Well, of course.

03:10.040 --> 03:12.300
I'm also a bit nervous.

03:15.800 --> 03:17.260
I'm sorry.

03:18.340 --> 03:20.550
I'm sorry for being a bother.

03:20.550 --> 03:25.130
But I want to be able to catch your passes, no matter what.

03:25.890 --> 03:29.350
I don't want to drag you down anymore.

03:31.020 --> 03:33.010
Sorry for not noticing.

03:34.600 --> 03:38.660
I might be the cause of your slump.

03:38.660 --> 03:40.560
N-No!

03:40.560 --> 03:41.690
I brought this upon myself...

03:45.910 --> 03:49.250
I feel responsible for you.

03:49.250 --> 03:50.910
We're a team, that's why.

03:50.910 --> 03:53.210
We need to support each other.

03:54.130 --> 03:56.380
Believe in your friends and help them out.

03:56.380 --> 03:59.790
That's the basketball you and your friends have taught me.

04:00.930 --> 04:02.800
Subaru-san...

04:03.180 --> 04:05.810
Tomoka, let's do our best together.

04:05.810 --> 04:09.050
Let's get better while getting past our worries.

04:09.940 --> 04:11.800
I want you by my side.

04:14.900 --> 04:16.480
I was scared...

04:17.190 --> 04:18.810
So scared...

04:19.280 --> 04:23.160
I thought I had disappointed you with my play...

04:26.250 --> 04:28.280
I'm not disappointed at all.

04:28.280 --> 04:31.290
Even if you miss one hundred times in a row,

04:31.290 --> 04:37.250
I'm sure you will bounce right back with one hundred and one amazing plays.

04:39.050 --> 04:41.290
Subaru-san...

04:44.300 --> 04:46.800
I'll do my best.

04:59.110 --> 04:59.640
Tomoka!

04:59.950 --> 05:00.740
Here!

05:05.370 --> 05:06.940
Mokkan, you're doing good!

05:07.580 --> 05:08.690
Yep!

05:08.690 --> 05:11.330
Seems like the secret training worked!

05:09.870 --> 05:11.330
What's the matter? Come at me!

05:12.410 --> 05:14.200
Attack me more!

05:14.630 --> 05:15.740
What's wrong, Airi?!

05:16.660 --> 05:18.870
Stop! Stop!

05:19.880 --> 05:22.330
Banri-kun, you're pressuring her way too much.

05:23.010 --> 05:24.390
S-Sorry.

05:24.390 --> 05:26.420
I get so heated up when I play basketball.

05:26.420 --> 05:30.140
I know that, but can you calm down first?

05:30.140 --> 05:31.890
Yeah, sorry about that.

05:41.820 --> 05:43.270
Oh?

05:43.450 --> 05:46.910
Mokkan, we've decided on the day for the rematch, right?

05:46.910 --> 05:48.280
Yeah!

05:48.280 --> 05:49.820
We can finally get our revenge!

05:50.330 --> 05:53.250
Do your best, you two!

05:53.250 --> 05:54.740
O-Okay.

05:54.960 --> 05:59.330
Only three of us are on the court, but we're all together during the match!

05:59.920 --> 06:01.130
Let's do our best!

06:01.130 --> 06:02.330
Yeah!

06:03.630 --> 06:05.890
I can't wait!

06:08.010 --> 06:10.340
It seems Tomoka-chan's back in the game.

06:10.720 --> 06:12.890
What training did she do during this short while?

06:13.940 --> 06:16.400
W-Well...

06:16.400 --> 06:17.440
Hasegawa!

06:19.110 --> 06:19.860
Here you go.

06:19.860 --> 06:20.730
What is it?

06:21.690 --> 06:24.440
This is the video of our match against Suga in middle school.

06:25.240 --> 06:27.280
Use it as reference when you're making strategies against him.

06:27.280 --> 06:28.530
Thanks!

06:31.240 --> 06:34.870
Hasegawa, about Airi...

06:34.870 --> 06:36.610
Banri, please!

06:37.170 --> 06:40.050
Airi is a girl who doesn't give up until the bitter end.

06:40.050 --> 06:41.670
That's right.

06:41.670 --> 06:44.870
Airi-chan has always solved any problem that got in her way.

06:44.870 --> 06:49.100
She absorbed every technique I've taught her.

06:49.100 --> 06:51.130
Please support Airi.

06:54.640 --> 06:55.810
I will!

07:35.100 --> 07:38.010
Come on! Come at me!

07:38.010 --> 07:40.360
Come on now!

07:40.360 --> 07:43.690
Why did Hasegawa choose him to play against?

07:43.690 --> 07:47.310
His fighting spirit is similar to Suga's.

07:48.030 --> 07:50.620
The reason he couldn't read Suga's jab step

07:50.620 --> 07:55.820
is because his fighting spirit and
aggression make the feint hard to read.

07:56.250 --> 08:00.340
But Subaru found out that it's not really that hard.

08:01.420 --> 08:02.790
Hell yeah!

08:03.920 --> 08:05.330
I got it!

08:09.220 --> 08:10.540
Takenaka!

08:11.930 --> 08:13.040
One more time!

08:33.530 --> 08:36.150
Oh yeah! Flawless victory!

08:36.150 --> 08:39.410
Subaru! Your movements are all weird!

08:39.410 --> 08:41.160
And your fakes are too obvious.

08:48.300 --> 08:49.420
<i>Why?</i>

08:49.420 --> 08:51.430
<i>My fakes aren't working.</i>

08:53.600 --> 08:55.390
What a disappointment.

08:55.390 --> 08:58.980
You always sound so high and mighty as a coach, too.

09:02.230 --> 09:04.400
Don't...

09:04.400 --> 09:05.810
Don't underestimate me!

09:12.600 --> 09:14.020
A floater?!

09:15.120 --> 09:16.080
Yes!

09:22.330 --> 09:25.000
That was cheap! And you call yourself an adult?

09:25.000 --> 09:26.250
Hey! Hey! Hey!

09:26.250 --> 09:28.340
I got a bit heated up...

09:30.470 --> 09:32.710
A floater, huh?

09:33.050 --> 09:35.470
That'll probably work against Suga.

09:35.470 --> 09:38.340
No, I can't use this yet.

09:38.770 --> 09:42.100
There's a greater chance that I won't score.

09:42.100 --> 09:44.100
I can't use an imperfect move against Suga...

09:44.100 --> 09:46.510
You're so lame.

09:46.520 --> 09:47.980
Who cares if it doesn't work?

09:50.530 --> 09:54.700
It's much better to shoot and fail than to be scared of shooting.

09:54.700 --> 09:57.570
I'm clutch, so I don't miss during crunch time.

09:59.910 --> 10:02.080
You may be right.

10:03.160 --> 10:05.320
That's pretty good, coming from you.

10:07.000 --> 10:08.950
Don't act so haughty!

10:08.950 --> 10:10.550
I'll beat you to the ground!

10:13.010 --> 10:16.140
<i>But... what am I doing wrong?</i>

10:29.570 --> 10:32.230
Oh? Your brother?

10:32.610 --> 10:33.740
Yeah.

10:33.750 --> 10:39.120
He's been practicing with me, but I haven't gotten any better.

10:39.820 --> 10:43.120
Why am I such a failure?

10:45.660 --> 10:49.660
You'll be fine, Airi. You're working so hard, too.

10:49.660 --> 10:51.340
So I'm sure you'll be fine.

10:53.210 --> 10:57.420
I'll practice with you until you say you've had enough.

10:58.050 --> 10:59.750
Hina-chan...

11:00.310 --> 11:02.810
We're all your friends.

11:02.810 --> 11:05.310
And we love you so much!

11:07.150 --> 11:10.400
Hina-chan... Thank you.

11:13.100 --> 11:16.020
Bust size

11:13.100 --> 11:16.020
Huge (She gets embarrassed when her friends rub them.)

11:13.100 --> 11:16.020
Words to Subaru

11:13.100 --> 11:16.020
Thank you so much for teaching
me so kindly every time... Teeheehee

11:13.100 --> 11:16.020
Name

11:13.100 --> 11:16.020
Kashii Airi

11:13.100 --> 11:16.020
Date of birth

11:13.100 --> 11:16.020
Blood type

11:13.100 --> 11:16.020
Class

11:13.100 --> 11:16.020
6th Year, Class C

11:13.100 --> 11:16.020
Height

11:20.270 --> 11:23.110
I couldn't stop you after all.

11:23.110 --> 11:25.610
Was my fake different from the usual?

11:25.610 --> 11:26.740
Not really...

11:27.660 --> 11:28.700
I see.

11:29.620 --> 11:32.790
Your fakes are very exciting.

11:34.000 --> 11:37.870
N-No! I don't mean anything weird by that!

11:37.870 --> 11:41.750
Um... I just never know what's coming next.

11:41.750 --> 11:48.090
We're the only ones here, but I find myself thinking whether you'll pass me the ball.

11:48.090 --> 11:50.340
Sorry if that sounded strange.

11:50.340 --> 11:52.850
It's not strange at all.

11:52.850 --> 11:54.850
But it is mysterious.

11:54.850 --> 11:58.980
How do you do such natural-looking fakes?

11:58.980 --> 12:00.560
Natural-looking?

12:01.150 --> 12:02.900
Oh! That's it!

12:18.370 --> 12:20.120
I-I stopped you!

12:22.380 --> 12:23.540
Thank you, Tomoka!

12:24.090 --> 12:26.920
With this, every problem is solved!

12:26.920 --> 12:29.300
R-Really?

12:31.010 --> 12:33.040
Fight! Fight!

12:33.040 --> 12:35.180
Subaru!

12:35.180 --> 12:36.560
Fight! Fight! Subaru!

12:36.560 --> 12:37.020
Hasegawa-san!

12:37.020 --> 12:37.930
Onii-chan!

12:37.930 --> 12:39.980
Go! Go! Subaru!

12:39.980 --> 12:41.730
Fight! Fight! Subaru!

12:41.730 --> 12:43.820
Go! Go! Subaru!

12:43.060 --> 12:45.230
Why me, too?

12:43.820 --> 12:46.570
Fight! Fight! Subaru!

12:47.030 --> 12:48.820
Fight!

13:01.960 --> 13:04.160
Since you challenged us for a second game,

13:04.160 --> 13:07.050
does that mean you are confident in stopping me?

13:08.590 --> 13:11.970
I don't want to say this, but right now I am not able to stop you.

13:11.970 --> 13:13.970
Stop screwing around alre—

13:13.970 --> 13:15.050
But we won't lose.

13:16.100 --> 13:19.140
Even if I don't win personally, as long as my team wins...

13:20.020 --> 13:21.100
Just that is enough!

13:23.020 --> 13:24.480
Nice steal, Tomoka!

13:25.610 --> 13:26.610
Th-Thanks!

13:31.190 --> 13:32.200
Run, Tomoka!

13:33.530 --> 13:34.740
Like she's gonna catch that...

13:40.620 --> 13:42.920
I-I did it, Subaru-san!

13:43.290 --> 13:45.170
Nice shot, Tomoka!

13:46.130 --> 13:47.670
Mokkan, you did it!

13:47.670 --> 13:49.670
You're in perfect sync with Hasegawa-san!

13:49.670 --> 13:50.460
Oh!

13:50.460 --> 13:51.760
That's my Tomoka!

13:52.180 --> 13:55.390
I hope the tide stays on our side...

13:57.720 --> 13:59.720
Um, here I go.

14:09.900 --> 14:11.570
I-I'm sorry.

14:11.570 --> 14:14.320
It's fine. The match has only just begun.

14:14.320 --> 14:15.570
We still have plenty of chances.

14:18.700 --> 14:19.200
Airi!

14:21.410 --> 14:23.040
Airi, it's all right.

14:23.040 --> 14:25.330
You can definitely beat Mayumi-san!

14:25.330 --> 14:28.460
Airi-chan, remember your training!

14:28.460 --> 14:30.170
Go! Airi!

14:30.170 --> 14:32.260
Don't lose, Airi!

14:32.260 --> 14:33.170
Oh!

14:33.170 --> 14:35.260
Give it your best, Airi!

14:35.260 --> 14:36.760
Okay!

14:36.760 --> 14:40.720
<i>I won't run away! I </i>can't<i> run away!</i>

14:43.850 --> 14:44.690
Airi!

14:49.520 --> 14:50.730
Are you okay, Airi?

14:51.150 --> 14:54.360
She fouled you there. It wasn't your fault.

14:54.360 --> 14:56.200
Just take it easy and do what you can do —

14:56.200 --> 14:57.990
I hate that!

14:58.200 --> 14:59.240
I hate it!

14:59.240 --> 15:02.250
I hate how I'm useless!

15:02.250 --> 15:05.540
I can't move how I want to move...

15:05.540 --> 15:07.580
Even though I worked so hard...

15:07.580 --> 15:09.880
My legs just freeze in fear...

15:11.540 --> 15:14.420
Is she really that scary?

15:14.420 --> 15:16.260
I'm sorry.

15:16.260 --> 15:17.930
I see.

15:17.930 --> 15:19.760
So how scary is she?

15:20.930 --> 15:22.010
How scary?

15:22.010 --> 15:25.640
For example, is she even scarier than me?

15:30.860 --> 15:33.780
You're way more scary!

15:34.280 --> 15:35.650
That so?

15:35.650 --> 15:37.110
Then everything's fine.

15:38.900 --> 15:41.570
You aren't a coward. Go get her.

15:41.570 --> 15:42.530
Okay!

15:45.710 --> 15:48.040
You're not scary anymore, Onii-chan.

15:48.460 --> 15:50.500
I know you're very kind.

15:53.250 --> 15:54.010
Airi!

15:54.010 --> 15:54.420
Yes!

15:57.880 --> 15:58.470
<i>Now!</i>

16:01.310 --> 16:02.770
Great job, Airi!

16:02.770 --> 16:04.030
Nice timing!

16:05.900 --> 16:07.780
Nice shot!

16:07.780 --> 16:09.660
That was amazing!

16:09.660 --> 16:11.950
Oh! Airi, you're so cool!

16:13.580 --> 16:14.700
Yeah!

16:15.910 --> 16:19.670
Jeez, we're getting pushed by elementary schoolers.

16:19.670 --> 16:22.040
My girls aren't doing so hot.

16:23.090 --> 16:25.880
You seem to be having fun though, Suga.

16:26.960 --> 16:28.420
Shut it!

16:33.220 --> 16:34.180
<i>What the?!</i>

16:38.680 --> 16:40.140
Tomoka!

16:41.150 --> 16:42.020
Are you okay?

16:42.020 --> 16:43.480
Yes, I'm fine.

16:43.480 --> 16:45.650
More importantly, I stopped him!

16:46.280 --> 16:48.280
I stopped him, Subaru-san!

16:48.280 --> 16:50.110
Yeah, you're the best.

16:51.240 --> 16:53.280
You're the best partner.

16:53.280 --> 16:55.240
Y-Yeah!

16:55.240 --> 16:56.660
<i>Was that a fluke?</i>

17:04.630 --> 17:05.800
He got stopped again!

17:05.800 --> 17:07.550
Wow! How's he doing that?

17:07.550 --> 17:09.630
Suga has a bad habit.

17:10.300 --> 17:11.430
Bad habit?

17:11.430 --> 17:15.760
Yes. Whenever he passes, he always has this angry look.

17:16.140 --> 17:21.020
But when he isos, his confidence rockets sky-high.

17:21.020 --> 17:24.770
Tomoka sees the iso coming and double teams him.

17:25.860 --> 17:26.820
Yay!

17:26.820 --> 17:27.690
Oh!

17:27.690 --> 17:29.110
Good job, Tomoka!

17:29.110 --> 17:31.570
But how did he find all this out?

17:32.490 --> 17:34.240
Ryuuichi Team

17:32.490 --> 17:34.240
Subaru Team

17:36.990 --> 17:39.160
Is this how you play basketball?

17:39.160 --> 17:40.120
Yeah!

17:41.120 --> 17:42.250
You satisfied with this?

17:43.080 --> 17:47.290
Not until I beat you one-on-one!

17:48.090 --> 17:50.010
Oh? Can you even do that?

17:51.130 --> 17:52.510
That's why I'm here.

17:59.520 --> 18:02.520
Show me what you've got.

18:02.850 --> 18:04.980
Sure. That's exactly what I'm doing to do!

18:13.570 --> 18:14.570
<i>A floater?!</i>

18:16.120 --> 18:17.700
Getting desperate now?

18:19.410 --> 18:23.290
Our school may not have an official team, but I haven't been fooling around.

18:25.460 --> 18:30.760
<i>Now Suga has to guard something other than a normal drive.</i>

18:30.760 --> 18:33.920
<i>His reaction time will become slower.</i>

18:34.300 --> 18:36.180
Your turn to attack, Suga.

18:36.180 --> 18:37.050
No need.

18:37.680 --> 18:39.890
I can blow by you anytime, so it'll be a waste of time.

18:40.930 --> 18:44.600
Or are you saying you have a plan for defense, too?

18:45.480 --> 18:46.730
Nope.

18:46.730 --> 18:48.400
I just go with the flow.

18:49.980 --> 18:52.490
Come on. Show me.

18:52.490 --> 18:54.450
You are hiding something, aren't you?

18:54.450 --> 18:55.450
Yep.

18:59.950 --> 19:00.790
Hey!

19:00.790 --> 19:02.240
You gonna play or not?!

19:02.240 --> 19:03.410
Of course.

19:13.090 --> 19:14.760
Great, Subaru!

19:14.760 --> 19:17.090
Wow! You're amazing, Subaru-san!

19:18.010 --> 19:19.840
It's only been a few days. What did you do?

19:20.180 --> 19:23.060
You were doing such obvious fakes before.

19:23.060 --> 19:26.390
I figured out my style of play.

19:26.390 --> 19:30.900
Well, it's more like someone <i>made</i> me figure it out.

19:31.650 --> 19:33.860
My fake should be natural.

19:33.860 --> 19:38.320
I don't have the talent like you to dress up my fakes like the real thing.

19:38.320 --> 19:44.120
But I figured out that I'm pretty good at making someone think otherwise.

19:44.120 --> 19:46.540
One more time! Come at me!

19:46.750 --> 19:49.210
Sure, as many times as you wish.

19:49.210 --> 19:51.250
I won't be using it for much longer anyway.

19:53.000 --> 19:54.260
Shut up.

20:02.470 --> 20:06.270
Don't think I've lost completely.

20:06.270 --> 20:08.640
I also don't think I've beaten you completely.

20:08.980 --> 20:10.270
We're not...

20:10.270 --> 20:11.520
...done here.

20:11.520 --> 20:13.480
We can settle this later.

20:13.480 --> 20:14.980
Next year.

20:14.980 --> 20:15.940
Sure.

20:15.940 --> 20:18.360
Let's play full court next time.

20:18.360 --> 20:21.200
5v5. Nashiba vs. Itoda.

20:22.450 --> 20:25.080
You need to make a team of five first.

20:25.660 --> 20:28.660
There won't be many more chances for you to play me when I'm fully serious.

20:28.660 --> 20:29.960
Yeah!

20:33.090 --> 20:36.590
You should get in on this too if you're serious, Kashii.

20:36.590 --> 20:37.510
Shut up!

20:37.510 --> 20:39.510
Don't get so cocky, you sore loser.

20:40.220 --> 20:43.640
I didn't lose! At least not completely!

20:43.640 --> 20:45.680
W-Wait, Ryuu!

20:45.680 --> 20:48.060
I-I'll remember this!

20:49.020 --> 20:51.100
Ryuu!

20:53.270 --> 20:56.070
Seems like we have a game set up.

20:56.070 --> 20:58.030
We need to respond in kind.

20:58.030 --> 21:00.070
Next year, for sure.

21:00.070 --> 21:01.110
Yeah.

21:01.990 --> 21:04.870
Thanks for today, everyone.

21:04.870 --> 21:06.490
You two were the best!

21:06.490 --> 21:08.700
It was fun playing together.

21:08.700 --> 21:10.410
M-Me, too!

21:10.410 --> 21:14.630
I was really happy to be your partner!

21:14.630 --> 21:15.540
Tomoka.

21:15.540 --> 21:22.510
U-Um, will I be able to become your partner, too?

21:23.300 --> 21:24.760
Airi.

21:24.760 --> 21:26.100
Wait right there!

21:26.100 --> 21:27.770
Wait!

21:27.770 --> 21:32.020
That's not fair! We want to become your partners, too!

21:32.020 --> 21:35.900
I'm sure I can be of help to you too if we're on the same team!

21:35.900 --> 21:38.030
Onii-chan! Me, too! Me, too!

21:38.440 --> 21:41.530
Of course, you're all my precious partners.

21:49.490 --> 21:50.330
Come on!

21:50.330 --> 21:52.080
Let's play some basketball!

21:52.250 --> 21:54.330
Okay!

21:56.590 --> 21:59.340
Rolling! Rolling! Growing!

21:59.340 --> 22:00.880
Rolling! Rolling!

22:00.880 --> 22:03.800
Keep on bouncing!

22:02.090 --> 22:04.810
Rolling! Rolling! Growing!

22:04.810 --> 22:07.220
Elementary schoolers are the best!

22:07.220 --> 22:07.600
Yay!

22:11.690 --> 22:16.690
Our bodies and our hearts are size SS,

22:17.190 --> 22:22.610
but our dreams can be size LL, can't they? Can't they?

22:22.610 --> 22:28.000
Adolescents have lots of troubles,

22:28.000 --> 22:33.580
but we'll overcome them together.

22:33.580 --> 22:39.010
I want to get even better!

22:34.380 --> 22:35.750
Even

22:35.750 --> 22:37.090
better!

22:39.010 --> 22:46.680
I want to see your face when I surprise you!

22:39.970 --> 22:40.630
Ooh!

22:41.300 --> 22:42.010
Wow!

22:46.890 --> 22:49.600
Just keep on spinning!

22:49.600 --> 22:53.520
The Earth is one big basketball!

22:53.520 --> 22:57.190
I'll believe in the future and move forward!

22:56.570 --> 22:58.110
I'll keep going!

22:57.820 --> 23:00.530
Just keep on spinning!

23:00.530 --> 23:04.490
The universe is one big basketball court!

23:04.490 --> 23:07.910
I want you to receive it.

23:07.200 --> 23:08.160
Ready, and!

23:07.910 --> 23:09.750
Pass! Pass! Pass!

23:10.160 --> 23:12.160
Please take it!

23:13.420 --> 23:16.170
Rolling! Rolling! Growing!

23:16.170 --> 23:17.710
Rolling! Rolling!

23:17.710 --> 23:20.590
Keep on bouncing!

23:18.840 --> 23:21.590
Rolling! Rolling! Growing!

23:21.590 --> 23:24.050
Elementary schoolers are the best!

23:24.050 --> 23:26.030
Yay!

23:28.390 --> 23:32.260
Tomorrow, I'll be going on a
training camp with everyone!

23:32.260 --> 23:33.270
Oh?

23:33.270 --> 23:37.690
We'll be staying the night, so I'll have to bring lots of handkerchiefs!

23:37.690 --> 23:40.400
Now then, see you later!

23:38.020 --> 23:41.020
Aoi Wins?

23:38.020 --> 23:41.020
Next episode
